Shipped in this repository
--------------------------

icons/hister.svg, searxng.svg  Neutral glyphs drawn for Machiya (this repository's licence), standing in for the
                                Hister and SearXNG logos in the Rooms menu.
config/hister/, config/searxng/ Reference configuration for Hister and SearXNG, written for Machiya (this repository's
                                licence). They configure those programs; they contain none of their code.
ui/, vaultkit/shell.py          The "Tokyo Night" and "Tokyo Night Day" colour palettes (by enkia, MIT licence;
                                github.com/enkia/tokyo-night-vscode-theme) are the basis of the apps' themes.

Everything else here (vaultkit, ui/, stack/, plugins/, compose/, docs/, the sample vault) is original to Machiya.
stack/mcp/vaultkit/ is a vendored copy of this repository's own vaultkit/.

Needed at run time, not distributed here
----------------------------------------

Python 3.11+ standard library        PSF licence
markdown (3.7 or later)              BSD 3-Clause (https://github.com/Python-Markdown/markdown)
PyYAML (6.x)                         MIT (https://github.com/yaml/pyyaml)
git, openssh                         their own licences (the container images install them from the OS)

The container images Machiya builds install these from PyPI and the OS at build time; a published image would carry
their licence texts in its own notices.
